       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PERFORMTHRU.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TOTAL PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
       01 I PIC 9(3) VALUE 1.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM ADD-STEP THRU ADD-STEP-EXIT UNTIL I > 10.
           DISPLAY "TOTAL: " TOTAL
           STOP RUN.

       ADD-STEP.
           ADD I TO TOTAL.
           ADD 1 TO I.
       ADD-STEP-EXIT.
           EXIT.
